# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layers 6+7: AttachToTarget's false return. The player is taken away
# from the pirates and a metroid latches on; the second Attack Activate then asks the player to
# take this metroid again, and AttachActorToPlayer refuses while the player already holds one.
@f300 layer 6
@f340 layer 7
@f560 god 1; give missile 20
@f580 send u0547 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate; send u0538 Activate
@f600 tp 300 -300 0
@f620 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f650 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 Attack
@f700 obj u0547
@f720 statecall u0547 Attack 0
@f760 obj u0547; status
@f800 statecall u0547 Attack 0
@f840 obj u0547
@f900 place u0538 player 2; fsm u0538 SelectTarget
@f950 statecall u0538 Attack 0
@f1000 obj u0538; obj u0547
